  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Coastal Vibes<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Welcome to this charming house nestled in scenic Seagrove Beach, Florida. You'll be just a short bike ride away from Seaside and a lovely walk away from two beach accesses for your convenience, as well as several fantastic dine-in restaurants. Check out the gorgeous sands of 30A Seagrove Beach on a perfectly sunny day with your family.<br><br><br><br>Step inside and discover an inviting open floor concept that provides spacious and comfortable living space for your vacation. The fully-equipped kitchen features sleek stainless steel appliances, allowing you to prepare delicious meals with ease. Gather around the dining area or pull up a stool at the bar, perfect for enjoying meals together or having casual conversations. Relax and have a movie night, courtesy of the smart TVs with Roku and YouTube TV. After a day of adventure, unwind in the cozy living area or step outside to the enclosed backyard, complete with patio chairs and an umbrella. It's the ideal spot to relax, soak up the sunshine, and savor outdoor moments.<br><br><br><br>Convenience is at your fingertips with a private washer and dryer, ensuring you can pack light and keep your clothes fresh throughout your stay. Whether you're looking to explore the stunning beaches, indulge in local cuisine, or simply enjoy quality time with loved ones, this Santa Rosa Beach house offers a comfortable and well-equipped retreat for your vacation.<br><br><br><br><b>Things to Know</b>",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Dog-friendly home with pool, patio, & washer&dryer"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
